00:58:15.450 --> 00:58:26.750
<v Ira Glass>Our managing editor is Sarah Abdurrahman. Our senior editor is David Kestenbaum. Our executive editor is Emanuele Berry. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange.

00:58:26.750 --> 00:58:51.690
<v Ira Glass>Just a heads-up to our Life Partners, there is a new bonus episode this week that's out that you will find in your feed. Everybody else, if you want to sign up and get this bonus content and other stuff, go to thisamericanlife.org/lifepartners. Thanks this week to Life Partners Kelly Darnell, Ken Erwin, Lauren Cahill Fitzsimmons, Lawrence Lin, Rob Nero, Laurel Paul, and Jeanie Thomas. Thank you, guys.

00:58:51.690 --> 00:58:58.480
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's confounder, Mr. Torey Malatia-- always comparing himself to Mr. Potato Head.

00:58:58.480 --> 00:59:01.540
<v Frank Filocomo>I have little glasses and holes in my ears.

00:59:01.540 --> 00:59:05.570
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:59:05.570 --> 00:59:10.570
